# Optional capabilities, as ranges. The file an install reads is requirements-optional.txt, written
# from this one by tools/lock_requirements.sh: exact versions with hashes, consistent with
# requirements.txt. Install it into the same environment, after the main set:
#   Windows:        .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install --require-hashes -r backend\requirements-optional.txt
#   Linux / macOS:  .venv/bin/python -m pip install --require-hashes -r backend/requirements-optional.txt
# Not named *.in for the reason given in requirements.ranges.
-c requirements.txt

